"[{\"id\": \"1\", \"tab_title\": \"Default Tab\", \"tab_content\": \"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"be604cfc-62fa-4024-9905-271cb23ed873\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"paragraph\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"center\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Copy, fill the brackets, ship. One prompt for every stage.\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8fb65dd-3063-47f1-a31b-f10f7527c0b5\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":2},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The 15 Prompts at a Glance\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"936aba55-9b73-453a-aa86-5d139cbf27ef\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"table\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\"},\\\"content\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tableContent\\\",\\\"columnWidths\\\":[null,null,null],\\\"rows\\\":[{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"#\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Prompt\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Use it when\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"01\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Write a Full PRD\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Before building anything new\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"02\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Create Your \\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"http://CLAUDE.md\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"CLAUDE.md\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Once per project, first session\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"03\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Ultra Plan Mode\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Any task touching multiple files\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"04\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Spec-Driven Development\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Features that must not drift\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"05\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Full UI &amp; UX Design Brief\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Before designing a screen or flow\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"06\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implementation Plan\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"After the spec is approved\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"07\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Wire Up an MCP Server\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Connecting Claude to outside tools\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"08\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Connect Your Database\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Setting up Postgres / Supabase\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"09\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Find Security Gaps\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Before anything goes live\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"10\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Debug an Error Fast\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The moment an error appears\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"11\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"E2E Test Your Application\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Locking in your money flows\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"12\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Clean Up Dead Code\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"When the repo starts feeling heavy\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"13\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Write Clean Git Commits\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every single commit\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"14\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Hooks as Guardrails\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Automating your quality checks\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]},{\\\"cells\\\":[[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"15\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Turn a Task Into a Skill\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Anything you have done 3+ times\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]]}]},\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cef16d53-f476-4ef5-b72e-229527263a38\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":2},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The Prompts\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"54c3569d-6018-41cf-8b2a-cbbbd79e54da\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"01 -- Write a Full PRD\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"976d3f91-83e7-47ea-b855-48f121a77156\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Write a complete PRD for the feature below.\\\\n\\\\nFeature: [DESCRIBE FEATURE]\\\\nUsers: [WHO USES IT]\\\\nStack: [YOUR STACK]\\\\n\\\\nInclude:\\\\n\\\\n* Problem statement + success metrics\\\\n* User stories with acceptance criteria\\\\n* Scope: what ships in v1, what does not\\\\n* Data model changes\\\\n* Edge cases + failure states\\\\n* Open questions for me to answer\\\\n\\\\nKeep it under 2 pages. Be specific, no filler.\\\\nSave it as docs/prd-[feature].md so every later\\\\nprompt can reference it.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"22890719-a00c-48d3-a3f3-a57806caaae1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"02 -- Create Your \\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"http://CLAUDE.md\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"CLAUDE.md\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}]}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a413561f-5643-4a70-b658-fc54a7ae3bb2\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Scan this entire codebase, then generate a CLAUDE.md.\\\\n\\\\nInclude:\\\\n\\\\n* What this project is, in 2 lines\\\\n* Tech stack + the versions that matter\\\\n* Commands: [DEV / BUILD / TEST / LINT]\\\\n* Architecture: where things live and why\\\\n* Code conventions you actually detect in the code\\\\n* Hard rules: [YOUR NON-NEGOTIABLES] -- what to\\\\n  never touch without asking\\\\n* Gotchas a new engineer would hit in week 1\\\\n\\\\nWrite rules as short imperatives. Nothing generic --\\\\nonly what is true for THIS repo. If you are unsure\\\\nabout a rule, ask me instead of inventing it.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3e5e46e3-ea10-463a-8a9e-65fe6d9bb4c4\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"03 -- Ultra Plan Mode\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"93f08582-10b9-40ba-9cac-a8d576022a72\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Enter plan mode. Do NOT write any code yet.\\\\n\\\\nTask: [PASTE TASK]\\\\nConstraints: [DEADLINE / STACK / NO-GO ZONES]\\\\n\\\\n1. Read every file this task touches, list them\\\\n   with one line on what each does today\\\\n2. Map current behavior vs target behavior\\\\n3. Propose 2-3 approaches with real tradeoffs:\\\\n   complexity, risk, blast radius\\\\n4. Pick one and justify it in 3 lines\\\\n5. Break it into steps small enough to verify\\\\n   one at a time, each with its own check\\\\n6. List risks + the exact rollback for each\\\\n7. Flag anything touching [AUTH / PAYMENTS /\\\\n   PROD DATA] for my explicit sign-off\\\\n\\\\nThen stop. Show me the plan and wait for my\\\\napproval before touching a single file.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5f10e8b9-7945-41dd-96e0-d77e16eb8562\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"04 -- Spec-Driven Development\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6d3f6162-3a94-407c-824d-081216f60fc0\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"We build specs first. Write a spec for: [FEATURE]\\\\n\\\\nContext: [WHO USES IT + WHY NOW]\\\\n\\\\nSpec format:\\\\n\\\\n* Behavior: given / when / then, every case --\\\\n  happy path, edge cases, failure states\\\\n* API contract: inputs, outputs, error shapes,\\\\n  status codes\\\\n* Data: schema changes + migrations needed\\\\n* UI states: loading, empty, error, success\\\\n* Non-goals: what this spec deliberately skips\\\\n* Acceptance checklist I can verify line by line\\\\n\\\\nAfter I approve the spec, implement EXACTLY the\\\\nspec. If reality forces a deviation, stop, update\\\\nthe spec, get my ok, then continue. The spec is\\\\nthe source of truth, not the code.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"17727f0a-ecd2-4eb5-9ed3-285c45b95d0e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"05 -- Full UI &amp; UX Design Brief\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7babc60c-5df3-486f-8292-960a77862b7e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Create a full UI/UX design brief for: [SCREEN OR FLOW]\\\\n\\\\nAudience: [USERS]\\\\nBrand: [COLORS / FONTS / VIBE]\\\\n\\\\nDeliver:\\\\n\\\\n* User journey through the flow, step by step\\\\n* Layout per screen: hierarchy, spacing, breakpoints\\\\n* Component inventory with every state --\\\\n  hover, empty, error, loading\\\\n* Typography + color tokens\\\\n* Motion: what animates, duration, easing\\\\n* Accessibility notes\\\\n\\\\nStudy patterns from [2-3 PRODUCTS YOU ADMIRE]\\\\nfor direction. Never copy them.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ffc46398-1611-46fa-89c5-2c41208baa79\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"06 -- Implementation Plan\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"45457f13-52f2-43f2-9532-a4c65d4a8855\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Create an implementation plan for: [APPROVED\\\\nSPEC / PRD]\\\\n\\\\nRules:\\\\n\\\\n* Sequence steps so the app compiles and runs\\\\n  after EVERY single step\\\\n* Each step: files touched, what changes,\\\\n  how I verify it works\\\\n* Flag steps needing a migration or new dependency\\\\n* Put the riskiest unknowns first\\\\n* Size each step: [S / M / L]\\\\n\\\\nOutput a numbered build sequence I can run one\\\\nstep at a time. Wait for my \\\\\\\"go\\\\\\\" between steps.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e906e222-e445-4972-b491-4bb3fd1cdff1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"07 -- Wire Up an MCP Server\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ee25ff19-ef1c-4ef1-983f-fbaa4b339fe2\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Wire up an MCP server for: [SERVICE / API]\\\\n\\\\nWhat I need it to do: [JOBS TO BE DONE]\\\\n\\\\n1. Check for an official or well-maintained\\\\n   existing server first -- name your source\\\\n2. If one exists: exact install command + the\\\\n   .mcp.json config, scoped to this project\\\\n3. If not: scaffold one with the MCP SDK --\\\\n   tools, auth, error handling, typed responses\\\\n4. Add ONLY the tools I will actually use: [LIST]\\\\n5. Wire secrets through [ENV VARS], never\\\\n   hardcode keys in the config file\\\\n6. Verify the connection and call one tool\\\\n   end to end, show me the output\\\\n7. Document each tool in 1 line so future\\\\n   sessions know when to reach for it\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"76962494-06a4-4fef-bd1a-80efbb3d738a\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"08 -- Connect Your Database\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d0d18c15-b09d-4558-be98-ea8a8a81e149\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Connect this app to [POSTGRES / SUPABASE / YOUR DB].\\\\n\\\\n* Pick the client that fits this stack,\\\\n  justify it in 1 line\\\\n* Env vars: name them, add to .env.example,\\\\n  never commit real values\\\\n* Schema: tables for [ENTITIES] with types,\\\\n  relations, and indexes for [HOT QUERIES]\\\\n* Create + run the migrations, and show me\\\\n  the rollback for each one\\\\n* One typed query helper per table -- no raw\\\\n  SQL scattered through components\\\\n* Access rules / row-level security if this\\\\n  is [MULTI-TENANT]\\\\n* Connection pooling if we are serverless\\\\n\\\\nThen prove it: seed one row, read it back,\\\\nshow me the output.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"df7868de-50d1-4ae0-b39d-4e59421f4606\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"09 -- Find Security Gaps\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"fb1b477c-9c92-43d1-bdf5-c7df956ea21b\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Audit this codebase for security gaps.\\\\nAttack it like you want in.\\\\n\\\\nFocus areas: [AUTH / PAYMENTS / USER DATA]\\\\n\\\\nCheck:\\\\n\\\\n* Secrets in code, config, or git history\\\\n* Injection: SQL, XSS, command, path traversal\\\\n* Auth: routes missing checks, weak sessions,\\\\n  broken redirects\\\\n* IDOR: can user A read user B&#039;s data?\\\\n* File uploads + input validation on every form\\\\n* Dependency CVEs -- run the audit, read it\\\\n* Rate limiting on [EXPENSIVE ENDPOINTS]\\\\n* What leaks through error messages and logs\\\\n\\\\nRank findings by severity with exact file:line,\\\\nfix the critical ones now, and list the rest\\\\nas tickets with effort estimates.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"166380b6-ec00-45d7-9ab9-f4d637219e7a\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"10 -- Debug an Error Fast\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"0beb4196-d61d-4497-bc39-4e8c1db52d8c\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Debug this error. Do NOT guess.\\\\n\\\\nError: [PASTE FULL ERROR + STACK TRACE]\\\\nWhen it happens: [STEPS TO REPRODUCE]\\\\n\\\\n1. Read the stack trace, open the exact files\\\\n   involved\\\\n2. State expected vs actual behavior in 1 line\\\\n3. List 3 hypotheses, ranked by likelihood\\\\n4. Prove or kill each one with logs or a tiny\\\\n   test -- evidence, not vibes\\\\n5. Fix the root cause, not the symptom\\\\n6. Search the repo for the same pattern -- if\\\\n   it can break here, it breaks elsewhere\\\\n7. Add a regression test that fails without\\\\n   the fix\\\\n8. Tell me in 2 lines why it broke and why it\\\\n   can never break this way again\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"07addf24-6b95-44ad-873a-592d67262c73\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"11 -- E2E Test Your Application\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a11e0c32-8cb4-4f44-9c77-2946e0e2d598\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Write Playwright E2E tests for: [FLOW]\\\\n\\\\nStack: [YOUR STACK] CI: [GITHUB ACTIONS / OTHER]\\\\n\\\\n* Money paths first: [SIGNUP / CHECKOUT /\\\\n  CORE ACTION]\\\\n* Test what the user sees, not implementation\\\\n  details\\\\n* Selectors: roles and labels, never brittle\\\\n  CSS chains\\\\n* One unhappy path per flow: bad input,\\\\n  network failure, expired session\\\\n* Tests stay independent -- any order, zero\\\\n  shared state, each seeds its own data\\\\n* Headless in CI, headed locally for debugging\\\\n* Screenshots + traces on failure only\\\\n\\\\nRun the suite, show me the results, fix what\\\\nfails, and tell me what the suite still does\\\\nNOT cover.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"df03d8ab-95c8-42b0-b7ed-75f885f020b2\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"12 -- Clean Up Dead Code\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c107b53e-3b59-4470-90c4-da282449084d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Find and delete dead code in this repo.\\\\n\\\\nScope: [WHOLE REPO / SPECIFIC FOLDER]\\\\n\\\\n* Unused exports, components, hooks, utils\\\\n* Unreachable branches + commented-out blocks\\\\n* package.json dependencies nothing imports\\\\n* Stale feature flags stuck always-on or\\\\n  always-off\\\\n* Duplicate logic that should merge into one\\\\n* Dead CSS classes and unused assets\\\\n\\\\nVerify with a search before EVERY deletion --\\\\ndynamic imports and string references count.\\\\nDelete in small commits, run [BUILD + TESTS]\\\\nafter each one, and report total lines removed\\\\nplus anything you were not 100% sure about.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"9952a9c4-2bf4-412a-ba39-76b96edb38cb\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"13 -- Write Clean Git Commits\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"28d763db-656f-4bf4-afe7-e9e5e2e8d23d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Commit my staged changes properly.\\\\n\\\\nConvention: [CONVENTIONAL COMMITS / YOUR FORMAT]\\\\n\\\\n* Split unrelated changes into separate commits\\\\n* Format: type(scope): what changed and why\\\\n  feat / fix / refactor / chore / docs / test\\\\n* Subject under 50 chars, imperative mood\\\\n* Body explains the WHY, wrapped at 72\\\\n* Reference the ticket: [TICKET-ID]\\\\n* Never mix a refactor with a behavior change\\\\n  in one commit\\\\n* Never commit [SECRETS / .ENV / GENERATED\\\\n  FILES]\\\\n\\\\nShow me the plan -- files per commit + messages --\\\\nbefore you commit anything. Then commit one at\\\\na time so I can stop you between them.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e3fbb4c7-1d96-40c3-982c-6a2657ad55ae\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"14 -- Hooks as Guardrails\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"11169362-f9e5-452b-bbc7-cf29f16dcd87\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"codeBlock\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"language\\\":\\\"javascript\\\"},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Set up Claude Code hooks as guardrails here.\\\\n\\\\nStack: [YOUR STACK + PACKAGE MANAGER]\\\\n\\\\n* PostToolUse: run [LINT + TYPECHECK] after\\\\n  every file edit, feed errors straight back\\\\n* PreToolUse: block edits to [PROTECTED PATHS:\\\\n  MIGRATIONS, .ENV, PROD CONFIG]\\\\n* Stop: run [TEST SUITE] before a session ends\\\\n* Notification: ping me with [SOUND / SLACK]\\\\n  when my input is needed\\\\n\\\\nWrite the hook scripts + the settings.json\\\\nentries. Keep each script under 20 lines and\\\\nexit non-zero with a clear message so the\\\\nagent knows exactly what to fix. Then trigger\\\\neach hook on purpose and show me it firing.\\\\n\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\"children\\\":[]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"88b145b4-9419-4139-8d2a-6aaace1802e0\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"heading\\\",\\\"props\\\":{\\\"textColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"backgroundColor\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"textAlignment\\\":\\\"left\\\",\\\"level\\\":3},\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"15 -- Turn a Task Into a Skill\\\",\\\"styles\\\":{}}],\\\